  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Control Review (ISK) of Union to Union 2021</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Revision (ISK) av Union to Union 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment concerns a review of Union to Union&apos;s capacity for internal governance and control in various areas according to the assignment&#xb4;s description. The reason is that Sida plans to enter into agreement on renewed global program support within the CSO strategy with Union to Union.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdraget g&#xe4;ller en granskning av Union to Unions kapacitet av interna styrning och kontroll inom olika omr&#xe5;den enligt uppdragsbeskrivning med anledning av att Sida planerar att ing&#xe5; avtal om ett f&#xf6;rnyat globalt programst&#xf6;d inom CSO strategin med Union to Union.</narrative>
  </description>
